<!--
  The public, indexable surface. Deliberately excludes the application itself: every
  extension-less path there returns the same SPA shell, so listing them would submit a set
  of identical documents.

  /pricing is served from its own static HTML rather than the SPA. It used to be a
  client-side route on app.html, which sends `robots: noindex` — so the page carrying the
  prices could not appear in a search result or be read by an answer engine at all.
-->
